  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-06-08T15:27:59.844Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Vrchat still uses same world loading system for years. When it works , don't touch it, right? But Neos and ChilloutVR have much better system, it just feels better.\nIn Neos you jump into world instanstantly and assets are loading on the fly, first 3D models, then albedo textures, normal maps and then rest of it. In ChilloutVR you see only downloading bar somewhere in corner, and after its finished, you will get smooth transition into new world, which last like 5 - 10 seconds.\nIt should be good if we had choice which loading system we wanna use, but i prefer ChilloutVR based loading system. You can talk with someone in actual world until you are loaded, if you are in current vrchat loading screen then you can only sit and look at downloading bar... if you have slower internet connection and that world is bigger one.\nMy idea for that is :\n- when you click on the button which normaly bring you to download screen, then menu closes and you will see in the corner of your view, downloading status in % with optional stats like , current download speed or estimated time until world will be downloaded.\n- After world is downloaded then green and red floating buttons should be showed at certain possition (in front of you, at your left or right side or at possition of your current look) Green with text 'Go' and red with text 'I stay' or After world is downloaded then you get directly teleported into that world but i prefer idea with buttons because if you are in middle of talk and vrchat finish downloading of that world, then your conversation will be cut right in the middle of talk.\n- Option for canceling download from QuickMenu. \n- Option to see in friendlist if someone is downloading world, and if that world is public or friends/+, then add here options, for joining to their current world or start downloading new world which that friend is downloading and if its possible join with him at same time. And if that friend is downloading instance for private world then you can guess if you catch him in current world until he moves or not, as you can't join with him but still you can send req for joinning into downloading queue as you normaly requesting invite from friends which are in invite or invite+ instances.\n- Option to see world size under name of that world. Normaly you see map size in main menu but not in QM preview.\nAnd because i also had second idea which is kinda connected to this, but its still something else, i maded second post here : https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/different-portals-for-different-purposes",
